Description: Conky desktop widgets, with a Spotify now-playing widget
 Shows the current Spotify track with album art, previous/play-pause/next
 controls, a draggable seek bar, a like button and smoothly scrolling synced
 lyrics from LRCLIB. The background takes its colour from the album art, and a
 top-bar icon offers start-at-login and Quit.
 .
 Built for GNOME on Wayland (runs through XWayland).

Package: conky-spotify-nowplaying
Section: oldlibs
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, conky-widgets (= ${binary:Version})
Description: transitional package for conky-widgets
 The Spotify now-playing widget now ships in conky-widgets, with every widget
 of the bundle. This package pulls it in on upgrade and can be removed.
